<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Robotic Vision cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Robotic Vision cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Alex. Brown said it downgraded Robotic Vision Systems Inc to neutral from buy.</p>
<p>-- Additional details not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Shares closed on Monday at 13-3/4.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
